{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_005_03_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7d9aabc45b06754084efdfce09f2e175714e72a7fb74922a162bbc24aee0b64f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b0714cc7022c3199ffb4b7084495d5b9d3ef6ea0cfe3d97ee14ca019e3e78a6",
      "text": "（买到新出的点心了，太好了。\n因为是今天才发售的，悠介应该也还没吃过）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eb9f276dc999f4abbe869f69bd99b6d742f9acd97ab9a033f92c4cb3805dcac",
      "text": "（被拜托买的其他东西也没问题。\n没有漏买的，好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b0604e445f47efab3a9a88e984957880e3f1b85fb4758931eef12f82169f439",
      "text": "……啊，肌贴好像快用完了。\n得买几个练习用的备着才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e20e82197ce9805cd261418f328f885ad4da2875f1b9c985a03a4c41c0554209",
      "text": "（去医院之前，顺路去一下体育用品店吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b322bc8a760d0df71d0377e2424fec9ce196e0077383416d448d3ef5fa549c0",
      "text": "啊，是享介大哥哥——\n呐，今天能一起踢足球吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23f7536e5a1194c6641c646c6b99538c97e1cbc2d5457340323e2d25ca3ac216",
      "text": "嗯，如果悠介说可以的话就踢哦。\n不过你们居然能认出我是享介呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa3740396f63ebc66eefcc0e50a23fb23db5e1afb95835519b7fd201cd058071",
      "text": "戴着眼镜嘛，穿的衣服也不一样。\n一眼就认出来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c854a51bdb5c6b67d44c3015408c048e3426a0f117e4b90e1dbc115217d3a20",
      "text": "待会儿我们去悠介大哥哥的病房找你们哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9662f23c56dd6342c3895a6b47030d17f0068443131bfcf7a40502b27477e306",
      "text": "哎呀，悠介君。\n不拄拐杖走路没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ac4dd8353f0f49ae86475a4ffea4cb164785d74b07ff39740270b7eab6a499a",
      "text": "不是的，我不是悠介，是弟弟享介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd57019eac24a829e04a9f1544e1d087d056b18d6cd1278f5c82993abd473926",
      "text": "哎呀，真是一模一样。悠介君平时经常陪我聊天的。\n我每天都盼着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_005w00_03_1_1_005_03:1_1_005_03_f:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b38400449785f9454fcb8f945dac6b7a3427149841fe6df139854d135c5d9578",
      "text": "（悠介无论在小孩子还是老人中间都很受欢迎啊。\n彻底融入这里了呢，真像他的作风）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
